  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF: Supporting the treatment of Severe Acute Malnutrition &amp; High-risk MAM &amp; provision of community-based services in Yemen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF: Overall Purpose: Reduce morbidity/mortality among women and children due to malnutrition in high-risk districts in Yemen.
Strategy:
&#x2022; Provide acute malnutrition treatment services to 18,500 children under five suffering from SAM and HRM through the procurement of 18,500 cartons of RUTF at targeted health facilities.
&#x2022; Conduct active case finding and provide preventive services to 385,007 children and 235,885 PLWs through CHNVs in the targeted districts.</narrative>
  </description>
